  "body": "## What\n\n- `grouped_split()`: StratifiedGroupKFold(10) over student ids → 80/10/10 by students\n- v1 kept as `window_split()` for reproducing the submitted numbers\n- tests: no student in two splits; v1 test.csv unchanged\n\n## Results (macro-F1)\n\n| model | v1 | v2 |\n|---|---|---|\n| majority | 0.21 | 0.21 |\n| GBM | 0.81 | 0.74 |\n| BiLSTM | 0.79 | 0.72 |\n\nCloses #1",
